    "description": "Benchmark of 56 language models with one of 14 implanted hidden behaviors that they do not confess when asked. An investigator (auditor) agent probes each target with a configurable tool set and proposes up to 10 quirk guesses. An LLM judge checks whether any guess matches the ground-truth behavior.",
